  <title>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Energia para todos: A Multi-donor trust fund for electricity access</narrative>
  </title>
  <description>
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">Support to increased access to electricity through a Multi Donor Trust Fund administered by the World Bank. The program is aligned with the new national electrification strategy aiming at universal access to electricity by 2030. Only about 30 percent of the population have access to electricity in Mozambique. Energy for all (Sustainable Development goal 7) is a priority for the Norwegian Government. The project has a strong gender equality component and plan to improve women&apos;s empowerment.</narrative>
  </description>
